
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Ajouter un catway - Port de Russell</title>

    <style>
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 30px 15px;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background: #eef3f7;
            color: #243447;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 30px;
            background: white;
            border-radius: 10px;
            box-shadow: 0 3px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
        }

        h1 {
            color: #174a6e;
        }

        label {
            display: block;
            margin: 20px 0 8px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        input, select, textarea {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 12px;
            border: 1px solid #cbd5e1;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-size: 16px;
        }

        textarea {
            min-height: 100px;
            resize: vertical;
        }

        button, .back {
            display: inline-block;
            margin-top: 20px;
            padding: 12px 16px;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 6px;
            background: #174a6e;
            color: white;
            font-size: 16px;
            text-decoration: none;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        button:hover, .back:hover {
            background: #23658f;
        }

        .hint {
            color: #64748b;
            font-size: 14px;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <main class="container">
        <h1>Ajouter un catway</h1>
        <p>Complétez les informations du nouveau catway.</p>

        <form action="/catways-page" method="POST">
            <label for="catwayNumber">Numéro du catway</label>
            <input
                type="number"
                id="catwayNumber"
                name="catwayNumber"
                min="1"
                required
            >

            <label for="catwayType">Type de catway</label>
            <select id="catwayType" name="catwayType" required>
                <option value="">Choisir un type</option>
                <option value="long">Long</option>
                <option value="short">Court</option>
            </select>

            <label for="catwayState">État du catway</label>
            <textarea
                id="catwayState"
                name="catwayState"
                minlength="2"
                placeholder="Ex. : Bon état"
                required
            ></textarea>

            <p class="hint">
                Le numéro doit être unique. Le type et l'état sont obligatoires.
            </p>

            <button type="submit">Créer le catway</button>
        </form>

        <a class="back" href="/dashboard">Retour au tableau de bord</a>
        <a class="back" href="/catways-page">Retour à la liste</a>
    </main>
</body>
</html>
